": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1DPjlQQk1ToQ7kNvwHfiixk&_nc_oc=Adqrv7gSf_g4JnIah7eLq68qra1sf4MlB0cvy8YJtIYNOkNZGuLYQpxFgXTF2uFmZkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSX1-tKXKOe0mIa5zv8UsjhMDtkD0A6DMWA5tkmxJnQkQ&oe=6AF1EF9B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cl3hbKHtQ2UQ7kNvwEW-Itq&_nc_oc=Adr47AR3JhDdur7mroLi9L1MW3BimJLmAOfLumvOdubNvLZYnlF-fFaiQ7ZNHu4t0Sw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRSKrp_-M55VrBvCtG2oJKx9wyz0z_7J7lItF4IWTY_xw&oe=6AF1DFE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EZE39_SkB2IQ7kNvwEz_n_M&_nc_oc=AdpVIhxfRq5loNg881zFbyQnlmUdrWeUIor7FbZEHY09W3bIV258yxsbYtvbi8E6brw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQeOXr9CxjRbUUsCIiYdEXlWk9sswFGbLjlt8KTQabOVw&oe=6AF204EF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=un7q5hg0Y2YQ7kNvwEnYk0z&_nc_oc=Adq518GCWtCVNH9P0ARDzG159Pc7WxESgGx9263JaI_ENAYY_piF4QBfWU2yrrHwESA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrJS5hzIiJ1SCXYb0INlqmH5DEHmo8klLen7tgq2UMYg&oe=6AF20492"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RMOys9aCiQ4Q7kNvwHTaZGw&_nc_oc=AdqEbKlfKM6nQW1gYop5oZptSGOP91MmvyOeRxBseOXto4TduXRTgJAGTn4pVo6PQHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjYNQIANuniJgXpJKRdkxSFi3iTOkC04o7ASXMQMZEKw&oe=6AF1D5FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a